  "description": "Stimulsoft Reports.WEB for .NET Core is a reporting tool designed to create and render reports in Web using native .NET Core cross platform report engine. Stimulsoft Reports.WEB will provide the complete cycle of report designing, from creating report templates and ending with showing them in a web browser. All this can be done without closing a web browser. Stimulsoft Reports.WEB is the reporting tool that allows you to edit reports directly in Web.",
